<p lang="en">
  The clearest takeaway: if you're on <strong style="color:var(--text2)">SGLang</strong>, use SpecForge. If you're on <strong style="color:var(--text2)">vLLM</strong>, use speculators. If you're on <strong style="color:var(--text2)">TensorRT-LLM or multi-backend</strong>, use TorchSpec. If you're doing <strong style="color:var(--text2)">algorithm research</strong>, use DeepSpec. The frameworks were designed around these use cases — using any of them outside their intended backend requires extra conversion work that negates their main design benefit.
</p>
<p lang="zh">
  最清晰的结论：如果你在用 <strong style="color:var(--text2)">SGLang</strong>，选 SpecForge；用 <strong style="color:var(--text2)">vLLM</strong>，选 speculators；用 <strong style="color:var(--text2)">TensorRT-LLM 或混合后端</strong>，选 TorchSpec；做<strong style="color:var(--text2)">算法研究</strong>，选 DeepSpec。这些框架正是围绕这些使用场景设计的——在预期后端之外使用任何一个都需要额外的转换工作，抵消了其核心设计优势。
</p>

<p lang="en">
  TorchSpec is the exception: it explicitly lists vLLM, TensorRT-LLM, and TokenSpeed as first-class inference targets, with a Worker Extension hook for vLLM, a patch for TRT-LLM's native "SaveHiddenStates" mode, and community support for SGLang. This makes it the natural choice for organizations running a heterogeneous inference fleet or planning to migrate between backends.
</p>
<p lang="zh">
  TorchSpec 是例外：它明确将 vLLM、TensorRT-LLM 和 TokenSpeed 列为一流推理目标，为 vLLM 提供 Worker Extension 钩子，为 TRT-LLM 原生 "SaveHiddenStates" 模式提供补丁，并为 SGLang 提供社区支持。这使其成为运行异构推理机群或计划在后端之间迁移的组织的自然选择。
</p>
</section>

<section id="s-scale" data-code="scale">
<div class="section-no"><span lang="en">05 — Scale & Storage</span><span lang="zh">05 — 规模与存储</span></div>
<h2><span lang="en">The Hidden Cost: Where Do the Hidden States Live?</span><span lang="zh">隐性成本：隐藏状态存在哪里？</span></h2>
<p lang="en">
  The most underappreciated design dimension is where Stage 1 hidden states live during training. This is not a config knob — it's a fundamental architectural choice that determines your storage bill, your training throughput, and whether you can even run the pipeline at your target scale.
</p>
<p lang="zh">
  最被忽视的设计维度是第一阶段隐藏状态在训练期间的存放位置。这不是一个配置旋钮——它是决定你的存储账单、训练吞吐量以及是否能在目标规模下运行流水线的根本架构选择。
</p>

