<h3><span lang="en">Offline vs. Online vs. Streaming</span><span lang="zh">离线 vs 在线 vs 流式</span></h3>
<p lang="en">
  <strong style="color:var(--text2)">Offline mode</strong> (SpecForge, speculators, DeepSpec) pre-generates all hidden states and writes them to disk before training begins. Training then reads from disk sequentially — fast if your storage tier is fast (NVMe SSD RAID), catastrophic if it's spinning disk or a slow network filesystem. DeepSpec's 38 TB figure is not an exaggeration: a single hidden state vector for a 4B model is ~4096 floats × 2 bytes = 8 KB. At 100B tokens, that's 800 TB before any layer stacking — the 38 TB figure assumes batching and compression tricks. Even so, it's a massive I/O commitment.
</p>
<p lang="zh">
  <strong style="color:var(--text2)">离线模式</strong>（SpecForge、speculators、DeepSpec）在训练开始前预先生成所有隐藏状态并写入磁盘。训练随后顺序读取磁盘——若存储层速度快（NVMe SSD RAID）则高效，若是机械磁盘或低速网络文件系统则是灾难。DeepSpec 38 TB 的数字并非夸大：4B 模型的单个隐藏状态向量约 4096 个浮点数 × 2 字节 = 8 KB，1000 亿词元下达 800 TB（上述数字假设了批处理和压缩技巧）。即便如此，这仍是巨大的 I/O 承诺。
</p>
<p lang="en">
  <strong style="color:var(--text2)">Online mode</strong> (speculators) generates hidden states just-in-time using a live vLLM instance running the target model alongside training. This removes the storage requirement entirely, but now your training throughput is coupled to how fast the target model can generate sequences. For large target models, this becomes the bottleneck.
</p>
<p lang="zh">
  <strong style="color:var(--text2)">在线模式</strong>（speculators）使用与训练并行运行目标模型的实时 vLLM 实例即时生成隐藏状态。这完全消除了存储需求，但训练吞吐量现在与目标模型的序列生成速度挂钩。对于大型目标模型，这会成为瓶颈。
</p>
<p lang="en">
  <strong style="color:var(--text2)">Streaming mode</strong> (TorchSpec via Mooncake) is the most architecturally novel: dedicated inference workers run the target model at full speed, and their hidden states are transferred directly to training GPUs over a high-speed memory fabric — bypassing disk entirely. Inference and training scale independently. The catch is operational complexity: Mooncake is a separate infrastructure component with its own configuration, and a known SEGFAULT on TCP-only hosts requires setting <code style="color:var(--cyan);font-size:.8rem">MC_STORE_MEMCPY=0</code> as a workaround.
</p>
<p lang="zh">
  <strong style="color:var(--text2)">流式模式</strong>（TorchSpec via Mooncake）在架构上最为新颖：专用推理工作节点全速运行目标模型，隐藏状态通过高速内存互联直接传输到训练 GPU——完全绕过磁盘。推理与训练可独立扩展。代价是运维复杂性：Mooncake 是有自己配置的独立基础设施组件，且 TCP-only 主机上已知的 SEGFAULT 需要设置 <code style="color:var(--cyan);font-size:.8rem">MC_STORE_MEMCPY=0</code> 作为绕过方案。
</p>

