<section id="s-community" data-code="community">
<div class="section-no"><span lang="en">06 — Community & Code Quality</span><span lang="zh">06 — 社区与代码质量</span></div>
<h2><span lang="en">Maintenance, Stars, and Who's Behind It</span><span lang="zh">维护情况、星标数与背后团队</span></h2>
<p lang="en">
  Code quality and community support are not soft metrics for a framework you'll be debugging at 3am. They determine whether a bug you hit has a filed issue, whether the code compiles against the latest PyTorch, and whether there's a human who will review your PR.
</p>
<p lang="zh">
  代码质量和社区支持对于一个你可能在凌晨三点调试的框架来说，不是软性指标。它们决定了你遇到的 bug 是否有已提交的 issue、代码能否在最新 PyTorch 上编译，以及是否有真人会审查你的 PR。
</p>

