<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: Drafter Training Frameworks Compared</h2>
    <p>Training a speculative decoding draft model requires three stages: extracting hidden states from the target model, training the drafter on those states, and deploying to an inference engine. Four open-source frameworks now handle this pipeline, each with a different bet on the key bottleneck.</p>
    <p>SpecForge, from the SGLang team, prioritizes maintainability and native SGLang integration. TorchSpec, from LightSeek, streams hidden states directly from inference GPUs to training workers via the Mooncake tensor store, eliminating disk I/O entirely. Speculators, from the vLLM team, emphasizes a standardized Hugging Face model format and the widest algorithm selection including EAGLE-3, DFlash, P-EAGLE, and MTP Finetuning. DeepSpec, from DeepSeek, provides a full-stack reproducible pipeline for comparing algorithms — its default setup requires approximately 38 terabytes of storage.</p>
    <p>The algorithm matters more than the framework. DFlash achieves acceptance lengths around 3.74 on math tasks versus 2.5 to 3.0 for EAGLE-3. DSpark, DeepSeek's architecture, improves further by 30 percent over EAGLE-3. The framework choice primarily follows your inference engine: SpecForge for SGLang, speculators for vLLM, TorchSpec for TensorRT-LLM or mixed fleets, and DeepSpec for research comparisons.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：推测解码训练框架对比</h2>
    <p>训练推测解码草稿模型需要三个阶段：从目标模型提取隐藏状态，在这些状态上训练草稿模型，然后部署到推理引擎。四个开源框架现在各自处理这条流水线，每个框架对关键瓶颈的判断各有不同。</p>
    <p>SpecForge 来自 SGLang 团队，优先考虑可维护性和与 SGLang 的原生集成。TorchSpec 来自 LightSeek，通过 Mooncake 张量存储将隐藏状态直接从推理 GPU 流式传输到训练工作节点，完全消除磁盘 I/O。speculators 来自 vLLM 团队，强调标准化的 Hugging Face 模型格式，支持最广泛的算法，包括 EAGLE-3、DFlash、P-EAGLE 和 MTP 微调。DeepSpec 来自 DeepSeek，提供了一个用于比较算法的全栈可复现流水线——其默认设置大约需要 38 TB 的存储空间。</p>
    <p>算法比框架更重要。DFlash 在数学任务上的接受长度约为 3.74，而 EAGLE-3 为 2.5 到 3.0。DeepSeek 的 DSpark 架构比 EAGLE-3 进一步提升约 30%。框架的选择主要取决于你的推理引擎：SGLang 用 SpecForge，vLLM 用 speculators，TensorRT-LLM 或混合部署用 TorchSpec，研究比较用 DeepSpec。</p>
  </div>
</div>

